{"4129040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEORUM", "steam_appid": 4129040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEORUM</strong> is a <strong>dungeon crawler</strong> set in a world where <strong>dark fantasy</strong> and <strong>cosmic horror</strong> collide just in time for the grand <strong>Divine Festival</strong>. <br><br>Follow the guidance of your mysterious watcher and delve deep into the forsaken labyrinth below. There, fight against deformed horrors and gather even more nightmarish materials. Your task is to craft coins of otherworldly nature. Only in this way will you be able to settle your debt to the eldritch powers at play.  <br><br>On this journey, you will learn forbidden knowledge and gain dark power, but will you have the courage to live up to the task? <i><strong>Will you forge your destiny and claim what's yours?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Gather </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d90a206bc5c9e3368c28d8d8778aea2a.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d90a206bc5c9e3368c28d8d8778aea2a.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d90a206bc5c9e3368c28d8d8778aea2a.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl carefully through the labyrinthine corridors below. Swing your pickaxe at brittle bones, living flesh, and otherworldly artifacts. Collect divine blood and gain insight beyond the veil of reality. Avoid traps, loot treasure chests, and offer yourself to cosmic powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the Horrors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2fa6019d0c0ac2c1e647a2f89376021b.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2fa6019d0c0ac2c1e647a2f89376021b.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2fa6019d0c0ac2c1e647a2f89376021b.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off monstrosities lurking in the dark. Flip arcane coins to activate symbols of power. Deal damage, protect yourself, and cause a variety of status effects. Luck may not always be on your side, but you can bend it to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft &amp; Earn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/7d674cfe37de366a3db5468adc1c7e3e.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/7d674cfe37de366a3db5468adc1c7e3e.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/7d674cfe37de366a3db5468adc1c7e3e.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return with the gathered materials and craft grotesque coins. Earn resources and reap the rewards. Merge materials together into more powerful &quot;ingredients&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow in Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/820a28defb18ef1d93d50a4eb06d9ae2.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/820a28defb18ef1d93d50a4eb06d9ae2.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/820a28defb18ef1d93d50a4eb06d9ae2.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings and upgrade your skills to challenge the deepest layers of the dungeon. Unlock new coin symbols or improve your endurance, deadliness, and luck. Unveil secrets of mysterious arcana cards to gain powerful perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obey the Divine Festival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/1e06177eb964abbd0bedab8b6179ebd2.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/1e06177eb964abbd0bedab8b6179ebd2.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/1e06177eb964abbd0bedab8b6179ebd2.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a divine purpose behind this madness. Follow the guidance of the mysterious watcher, learn the cosmic truth, and embrace what fate the Providence has prepared for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 layers of the dungeon to explore, split into 3 distinct zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple monsters to fight, materials to gather and craft, and arcane coin symbols to interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tree of upgrades to unlock. A deck of perk cards to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic horror narrative and an unsettling horror atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ hours of playtime </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEORUM</strong> is a <strong>dungeon crawler</strong> set in a world where <strong>dark fantasy</strong> and <strong>cosmic horror</strong> collide just in time for the grand <strong>Divine Festival</strong>. <br><br>Follow the guidance of your mysterious watcher and delve deep into the forsaken labyrinth below. There, fight against deformed horrors and gather even more nightmarish materials. Your task is to craft coins of otherworldly nature. Only in this way will you be able to settle your debt to the eldritch powers at play.  <br><br>On this journey, you will learn forbidden knowledge and gain dark power, but will you have the courage to live up to the task? <i><strong>Will you forge your destiny and claim what's yours?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Gather </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d90a206bc5c9e3368c28d8d8778aea2a.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d90a206bc5c9e3368c28d8d8778aea2a.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/d90a206bc5c9e3368c28d8d8778aea2a.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl carefully through the labyrinthine corridors below. Swing your pickaxe at brittle bones, living flesh, and otherworldly artifacts. Collect divine blood and gain insight beyond the veil of reality. Avoid traps, loot treasure chests, and offer yourself to cosmic powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the Horrors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2fa6019d0c0ac2c1e647a2f89376021b.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2fa6019d0c0ac2c1e647a2f89376021b.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/2fa6019d0c0ac2c1e647a2f89376021b.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off monstrosities lurking in the dark. Flip arcane coins to activate symbols of power. Deal damage, protect yourself, and cause a variety of status effects. Luck may not always be on your side, but you can bend it to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft &amp; Earn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/7d674cfe37de366a3db5468adc1c7e3e.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/7d674cfe37de366a3db5468adc1c7e3e.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/7d674cfe37de366a3db5468adc1c7e3e.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return with the gathered materials and craft grotesque coins. Earn resources and reap the rewards. Merge materials together into more powerful &quot;ingredients&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow in Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/820a28defb18ef1d93d50a4eb06d9ae2.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/820a28defb18ef1d93d50a4eb06d9ae2.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/820a28defb18ef1d93d50a4eb06d9ae2.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings and upgrade your skills to challenge the deepest layers of the dungeon. Unlock new coin symbols or improve your endurance, deadliness, and luck. Unveil secrets of mysterious arcana cards to gain powerful perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obey the Divine Festival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/1e06177eb964abbd0bedab8b6179ebd2.poster.avif?t=1785139484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/1e06177eb964abbd0bedab8b6179ebd2.webm?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/extras/1e06177eb964abbd0bedab8b6179ebd2.mp4?t=1785139484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a divine purpose behind this madness. Follow the guidance of the mysterious watcher, learn the cosmic truth, and embrace what fate the Providence has prepared for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 layers of the dungeon to explore, split into 3 distinct zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple monsters to fight, materials to gather and craft, and arcane coin symbols to interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tree of upgrades to unlock. A deck of perk cards to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic horror narrative and an unsettling horror atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ hours of playtime </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Descend into the forsaken dungeon and fight the horrors in the dark. Gather occult materials, craft nightmarish coins, and settle your debt to the cosmic powers. Obey the Divine Festival.", "supported_languages": "English, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/317a8ff7918fe70a221793b357b2ea669c003981/header.jpg?t=1785139484", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/6ea11d5715c7a602428b2b092c4508b5facea91e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785139484", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129040/6ea11d5715c7a602428b2b092c4508b5facea91e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785139484", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel/Amd 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11, 2GB, dedicated GPU recommended<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb